## Summary

Built the **P1/S0-0002 UI-prompt generator** ΓÇö the manifest-driven prompt factory.

**Created:**
- `apps/tools/gen-ui-prompts.ts` ΓÇö reads `apps/parity/parity-manifest.json`, filters the 153 `page` units, enriches each with its child `api` hooks, and renders one prompt per page per platform. Supports write mode + `--check` drift mode (fails on content diff, missing, or orphan files). Deterministic (LF-normalized, id-sorted, stale-file pruning).
- `apps/tools/templates/{windows,android,apple}.page.prompt.hbs` ΓÇö three Handlebars templates encoding WinUI3/Fluent, Compose/Material3, and SwiftUI/HIG conventions, shared-core binding, design tokens, 3 data states, i18n, a11y, and the `=== PARITY ===` gate.

**Generated:** 462 files ΓÇö 153 prompts each under `p2-windows/pages/`, `p3-android/pages/`, `p4-apple/pages/`, plus a per-platform `INDEX.md` in dependency order (foundational ΓåÆ list ΓåÆ feature ΓåÆ detail).

Each generated prompt embeds the real unit data (panels/charts/maps/states/strings/data-sources) and all 7 required sections: frontmatter+title+covenant, artifact metadata (scoped allowed files), the copied parity unit, platform impl spec, `PARITY_REQUIRED=<requiredCount>` + per-item checklist, the platform triad gate, and the commit + `EXIT/STATUS` footer.

**Gate results:** `WIN=153 AND=153 APL=153 PAGES=153`, `--check` clean, `EXIT=0 STATUS=DONE`. Handlebars triple-stache avoids HTML-escaping (verified: zero entity corruption, `{{name}}` i18n interpolations preserved).


